When generating a Git commit message, write the subject and body in Simplified Chinese only. Never write English sentences. Keep identifiers such as PayCenter, API, watermark inside the Chinese sentence.

Format:

<type>(<scope>): <简体中文标题>

<简体中文正文>

- type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
- scope: optional lowercase English noun
- subject: Simplified Chinese, imperative, no period, at most 50 characters
- body: optional, one blank line, Simplified Chinese, explain why

Example:

feat(payment): 接入 PayCenter 充值

补上支付下单、查单和回调，方便对账。

Forbidden:

feat: Integrate PayCenter top-up functionality
